+/* geno-fx: which of the Beam model's parts show (projects/geno/fx/beam_model.py: the root's children are the trail, the
+ * head and the up throw's star). The Beam's states show the trail and the head; the throw's state (3) shows only the
+ * star, a spinning gold star (it faces the camera, so the root's turn along the flight doesn't touch it) */
+static void itGe_BeamParts(Item_GObj* g, bool star)
+{
